#: ../../source/docs/development/mavdevenvwindows.rst:3
#: 32bde7e377a343819be814ad72bc4b7d
msgid "Windows Development Environment"
msgstr "Windows 开发环境"

#: ../../source/docs/development/mavdevenvwindows.rst:5
#: d84b40d6233645a8af0fa99dda1f8d3b
msgid "You will need to have `Python <http://www.python.org>`_ 3"
msgstr "您需要安装 `Python <http://www.python.org>`_ 3"

#: ../../source/docs/development/mavdevenvwindows.rst:7
#: ab9c5ed2ff1746fe84ad6b702c557a4d
msgid ""
"It is assumed that Python and pip are on the system path. If not, see `here "
"<https://datatofish.com/add-python-to-windows-path/>`_ for instructions."
msgstr ""
"假设 Python 和 pip 已添加到系统路径中。如果没有，请参阅 `此处 <https://datatofish.com/add-python-"
"to-windows-path/>`_ 获取操作说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/development/mavdevenvwindows.rst:9
#: f915c311e891491a844d5f45305d4bd3
msgid "To install the required libraries:"
msgstr "安装所需库："

#: ../../source/docs/development/mavdevenvwindows.rst:17
#: 06797465b9824cadb3d0f2b91a49b3f1
msgid ""
"Download the MAVProxy `source <https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy>`_."
msgstr "下载 MAVProxy `源代码 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy>`_。"

#: ../../source/docs/development/mavdevenvwindows.rst:19
#: ce8a8b9d41b448c9bbad7da200e09d82
msgid ""
"After making the desired changes, MAVProxy is required to be compiled into "
"the Python directory (the modules won't work otherwise). This needs to "
"happen after any changes to the source code. This can be done by running the"
" :file:`./MAVProxy/MAVProxyWinUSB.bat` or "
":file:`./MAVProxy/MAVProxyWinLAN.bat` file. This will perform the necessary "
"build actions and then run MAVProxy. Some of the details in the batch files "
"(port numbers, etc) may need to be altered to match the user's system "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"完成所需修改后，需要将 MAVProxy 编译到 Python 目录中（否则模块无法正常工作）。每次修改源代码后都需要执行此操作。可通过运行 "
":file:`./MAVProxy/MAVProxyWinUSB.bat` 或 "
":file:`./MAVProxy/MAVProxyWinLAN.bat` 文件来完成。这将执行必要的构建操作并启动 "
"MAVProxy。批处理文件中的部分参数（如端口号等）可能需要根据用户的系统配置进行调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/development/mavdevenvwindows.rst:28
#: 9b1c06f487cf44fa95f451cd58c9bd17
msgid ""
"To create a one-click windows installer for MAVProxy, run "
"``MAVProxyWinBuild.bat```, which is in the ``./windows`` directory. The "
"installer will be created in the ``./windows/output`` directory. The `Inno "
"Setup <http://www.jrsoftware.org/isdl.php#stable>`_ program will be required"
" for this process and is assumed to be installed in the ``C:\\Program Files "
"(x86)\\Inno Setup 6\\`` folder"
msgstr ""
"若要为 MAVProxy 创建单击即可运行的 Windows 安装程序，请运行 ``MAVProxyWinBuild.bat`` `，该文件位于 "
"``./windows`` 目录中。安装程序将在 ``./windows/output`` 目录中生成。此过程需要 `Inno Setup "
"<http://www.jrsoftware.org/isdl.php#stable>`_ 程序，并假定其已安装在 ``C:\\Program "
"Files (x86)\\Inno Setup 6\\`` 文件夹中。"
